          "index": 1,
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "Understood. Here's a minimal versioned router:\n\n```ts src/router.ts\nexport const router = createRouter({ prefix: '/v1' });\n```\n\nWe'll use Fastify for the HTTP layer since it has first-class TypeScript types."
        },
